# Extraction engine. These three versions are pinned EXACTLY, carrying forward a
# landmine documented by the project this engine is ported from: calling
# tree_sitter_language_pack.get_parser("c_sharp") (underscored) triggers a
# DownloadError against a 371-language manifest. Production routes every
# ecosystem through the pack's own spelling, "csharp", which works offline.
